WEBVTT

00:00.641 --> 00:03.641
[lively tropical music]
[活泼的热带音乐]

00:03.641 --> 00:10.208
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:10.208 --> 00:11.408
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

00:11.408 --> 00:12.875
- What you see before you
- 你所看到的

00:12.875 --> 00:15.141
is the culmination
of my lifelong dream.
是顶峰
我一生的梦想。

00:15.141 --> 00:17.075
A place of my own
where I can work out
一个属于我自己的地方
我可以在哪里锻炼

00:17.075 --> 00:18.808
every day, any time I want.
每天，任何我想要的时间。

00:18.808 --> 00:20.341
Larry's Gym!
拉里的健身房！

00:20.341 --> 00:22.475
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

00:22.475 --> 00:25.375
[cheering continues]
[欢呼声继续]

00:25.375 --> 00:26.408
[scissors slice]
- Ow!
[剪刀切片]
- 噢！

00:26.408 --> 00:27.775
- Looking out at this sea
- 眺望这片大海

00:27.775 --> 00:29.608
of flaccid muscles
and sagging flesh,
松弛的肌肉
以及下垂的肉，

00:29.608 --> 00:31.275
frankly, I'm disgusted.
坦白说，我很反感。

00:31.275 --> 00:32.775
all:
Aww.
全部：
哇。

00:32.775 --> 00:34.775
- Therefore, I'm opening the gym
- 所以我要开健身房

00:34.775 --> 00:36.775
to everyone in Bikini Bottom.
致比基尼堡的每个人。

00:36.775 --> 00:38.875
all:
Yeah! Whoo-hoo!
全部：
是啊！呼呼！

00:38.875 --> 00:40.875
- For the price
of a lifetime membership.
- 对于价格
终身会员资格。

00:40.875 --> 00:42.408
all:
Aww.
全部：
哇。

00:42.408 --> 00:44.775
- But today, everything is free!
- 但今天，一切都是免费的！

00:44.775 --> 00:46.241
all:
Yeah!
全部：
是啊！

00:46.241 --> 00:49.308
- Shape us and mold us
in your image.
-塑造我们并塑造我们
在你的形象中。

00:49.308 --> 00:50.441
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

00:50.441 --> 00:51.908
- You're the lobster, Larry.
- 你是龙虾，拉里。

00:51.908 --> 00:53.375
The alpha lobster.
阿尔法龙虾。

00:53.375 --> 00:56.275
- Well, I don't know
if I'd say that.
- 嗯，我不知道
如果我这么说的话。

00:56.275 --> 00:59.041
- Oh, I filled out
a membership form.
- 哦，我填了
会员表格。

00:59.041 --> 01:00.308
- Ooh.
- 哦。

01:00.308 --> 01:01.441
- Me too.
- 我也是。

01:01.441 --> 01:02.941
- What's in that pink box?
- 那个粉色盒子里装的是什么？

01:02.941 --> 01:05.508
- Uh, doughnuts, sir.
- 呃，甜甜圈，先生。

01:05.508 --> 01:07.575
- "Dough nut"
bring those in here!
- “面团坚果”
把那些带进来！

01:07.575 --> 01:09.575
In the meantime,
enjoy yourself
与此同时，
玩得开心

01:09.575 --> 01:12.775
because your first visit
is free.
因为你第一次来
是免费的。

01:12.775 --> 01:15.841
- Is it true that
everything is free?
- 这是真的吗
一切都是免费的？

01:15.841 --> 01:16.975
- That's right, sir.
- 是的，先生。

01:16.975 --> 01:19.141
For your first visit, we--
对于您的第一次访问，我们——

01:19.141 --> 01:20.441
Hello?
你好？

01:20.441 --> 01:23.408
In conclusion,
I'm at your service
总之，
我随时为您服务

01:23.408 --> 01:28.441
to turn anyone, anyone, into a
rippling heap of muscle glory!
把任何人，任何人，变成
荡漾堆肌肉的荣耀！

01:28.441 --> 01:31.341
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:31.341 --> 01:34.541
- Boy, I've got my work
cut out for me.
- 男孩，我有工作了
为我剪下来。

01:34.541 --> 01:36.808
The doors are automatic.
门是自动的。

01:36.808 --> 01:38.375
Just step on the mat.
只需踩在垫子上即可。

01:38.375 --> 01:40.375
- Oh!
- 哦！

01:40.375 --> 01:43.908
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:43.908 --> 01:45.508
- [growls]
Here.
- [咆哮]
在这里。

01:45.508 --> 01:47.175
- Ah, thanks, Larry.
- 啊，谢谢，拉里。

01:47.175 --> 01:48.275
- Ugh.
- 呃。

01:48.275 --> 01:49.841
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:49.841 --> 01:51.108
- Uh, what are you doing?
- 呃，你在做什么？

01:51.108 --> 01:53.541
- You said everything was free.
- 你说一切都是免费的。

01:53.541 --> 01:55.075
- [laughs]
No, no.
- [笑]
不，不。

01:55.075 --> 01:57.808
Your first visit is free.
您的第一次访问是免费的。

01:57.808 --> 02:00.408
- So what you're saying is,
if I never leave,
- 所以你的意思是
如果我永不离开

02:00.408 --> 02:02.241
it'll be free forever!
它将永远免费！

02:02.241 --> 02:03.875
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:03.875 --> 02:06.341
- Time to go live the dream.
- 是时候实现梦想了。

02:06.341 --> 02:09.941
Right after I file
this paperwork.
就在我提交文件后
这份文书工作。

02:09.941 --> 02:13.008
I didn't think there'd be
so much of it.
我没想到会有
这么多。

02:13.008 --> 02:15.408
- Excuse me, Larry,
I was just working out
- 对不起，拉里，
我刚刚在锻炼

02:15.408 --> 02:17.775
and I was wondering,
is this normal?
我想知道，
这是正常的吗？

02:17.775 --> 02:18.908
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

02:18.908 --> 02:20.841
Even your cramps have cramps.
甚至你的抽筋也有抽筋。

02:20.841 --> 02:23.441
You need to follow
my number one rule:
你需要遵循
我的第一条规则：

02:23.441 --> 02:25.441
always be hydrating.
始终保持保湿。

02:25.441 --> 02:26.541
- Fine.
- 美好的。

02:26.541 --> 02:28.475
[gulping]
[吞咽]

02:30.275 --> 02:33.875
Gee, Larry, you think
I'll ever be as strong as you?
哎呀，拉里，你认为
我会像你一样坚强吗？

02:33.875 --> 02:36.375
- Sure! What kind of
a gym owner would I be
- 当然！什么样的
我会成为健身房老板

02:36.375 --> 02:39.775
if I couldn't take a puny,
squishy, lump like you?
如果我不能承受一点点
像你一样软软的、肿块的？

02:39.775 --> 02:41.241
- [laughs]
Squishy.
- [笑]
软软的。

02:41.241 --> 02:44.541
- What I'm saying is,
I can make you a man.
- 我想说的是，
我可以让你成为一个男人。

02:44.541 --> 02:45.941
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

02:45.941 --> 02:48.775
- I'm gonna make you
my personal project.
- 我会让你
我的个人项目。

02:48.775 --> 02:51.775
Of course, you'll have to sign
up for a lifetime membership.
当然，你得签字
获得终身会员资格。

02:51.775 --> 02:53.341
- I'm ready!
- 我准备好了！

02:53.341 --> 02:56.208
[grunting and groaning]
[咕哝和呻吟]

02:56.208 --> 03:00.308
- That reminds me, you need
to start hydrating right now.
- 这提醒了我，你需要
现在就开始补水。

03:00.308 --> 03:02.275
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

03:02.275 --> 03:04.341
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

03:04.341 --> 03:07.941
- And remember,
always be hydrating!
- 请记住，
平时要注意保湿！

03:07.941 --> 03:10.141
- Okay, I will.
- 好的，我会的。

03:10.141 --> 03:11.841
- That's what I like to see.
- 这就是我喜欢看到的。

03:11.841 --> 03:13.541
Come on,
we'll finish those later.
来吧，
我们稍后会完成这些。

03:13.541 --> 03:15.108
- Good, 'cause I was
really crashing there,
- 很好，因为我是
真的在那里崩溃了，

03:15.108 --> 03:17.208
signing those papers.
签署这些文件。

03:17.208 --> 03:18.841
"Feeling the burn,"
is that what you call it?
“感觉到灼烧感，”
你就是这么称呼它的吗？

03:18.841 --> 03:20.175
I heard angels singing.
我听到天使在唱歌。

03:20.175 --> 03:21.908
Beautiful angels.
That's normal, right?
美丽的天使。
这很正常，对吧？

03:21.908 --> 03:24.475
- It's Larry!
King of the gym!
- 是拉里！
健身房之王！

03:24.475 --> 03:25.841
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

03:25.841 --> 03:27.541
- Oh, you guys.
- 哦，你们。

03:27.541 --> 03:30.941
I'm just an ordinary
alpha lobster doing his job.
我只是一个普通人
阿尔法龙虾正在做他的工作。

03:30.941 --> 03:32.275
Towel boy!
毛巾小子！

03:32.275 --> 03:34.775
Polish this crown
for me, will you?
打磨这顶王冠
为了我，你愿意吗？

03:34.775 --> 03:36.475
- Hey, join us, boy.
- 嘿，加入我们吧，男孩。

03:36.475 --> 03:40.508
Oh, I can't believe
I'm allowed to lift these
哦，我不敢相信
我可以举起这些

03:40.508 --> 03:45.641
really heavy pieces of metal
for free.
非常重的金属件
免费。

03:45.641 --> 03:47.775
[grunting]
Oh.
[咕噜声]
哦。

03:47.775 --> 03:49.341
[gulps]
[吞咽]

03:49.341 --> 03:50.808
Free.
自由的。

03:50.808 --> 03:52.008
- I don't know, Larry.
- 我不知道，拉里。

03:52.008 --> 03:54.008
I'm not good at
lifting things.
我不擅长
举起东西。

03:55.041 --> 03:59.041
Aah! Aah! Ow!
啊啊！啊啊！噢！

03:59.041 --> 04:01.641
Ooh!
[groans]
哦！
[呻吟]

04:01.641 --> 04:03.775
Aah!
啊啊！

04:03.775 --> 04:06.841
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:06.841 --> 04:08.308
Ow!
噢！

04:09.775 --> 04:11.341
- Let me see.
- 让我看看。

04:11.341 --> 04:14.808
I may have something
that'll work for you.
我可能有东西
这对你有用。

04:14.808 --> 04:16.875
Here we go.
开始了。

04:16.875 --> 04:21.008
Cotton swabs, cotton balls.
棉签、棉球。

04:21.008 --> 04:23.541
Here, try this on
for size, Hercules.
来，试试这个
对于尺寸，赫拉克勒斯。

04:25.008 --> 04:28.141
- [grunting, groaning]
- [咕哝，呻吟]

04:28.141 --> 04:28.941
Aah!
啊啊！

04:28.941 --> 04:30.108
How am I doing?
我怎么样？

04:30.108 --> 04:31.875
- Pathetic.
- 可怜的。

04:31.875 --> 04:33.341
- Look, Larry, I'm hydrating.
- 拉里，你看，我正在补充水分。

04:33.341 --> 04:36.975
Oh, I am hydrating so much.
哦，我的水分太多了。

04:36.975 --> 04:40.441
- Yeah, I've got another
idea, SpongeBob.
- 是的，我还有另一个
想法，海绵宝宝。

04:40.441 --> 04:42.375
Come with me.
跟我来吧。

04:43.908 --> 04:45.608
First thing tomorrow morning,
明天早上第一件事，

04:45.608 --> 04:48.608
this is gonna be where
I lead my exercise class.
这将是在哪里
我带领我的运动课。

04:48.608 --> 04:50.641
- I'll be there.
- That's the spirit.
- 我会在那里。
- 这就是精神。

04:50.641 --> 04:53.141
And we're going to get you
started early.
我们会找到你
很早就开始了。

04:53.141 --> 04:54.808
Let me see some crunches.
让我看看一些仰卧起坐。

04:54.808 --> 04:57.308
- [crunching loudly]
- [嘎吱嘎吱地响]

04:57.308 --> 05:00.675
- The only thing I want
to see in your mouth
- 我唯一想要的
在你嘴里看到

05:00.675 --> 05:02.108
is that water bottle.
是那个水瓶吗？

05:02.108 --> 05:03.775
Now, what did I tell you?
现在，我告诉你了什么？

05:03.775 --> 05:05.775
Always be hydrating!
平时一定要注意保湿！

05:05.775 --> 05:07.808
Now I'll show you some crunches.
现在我将向您展示一些仰卧起坐。

05:07.808 --> 05:10.575
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:10.575 --> 05:11.841
- Oh, I can do that.
- 哦，我能做到。

05:11.841 --> 05:13.541
That's what I do when I laugh.
我笑的时候就是这么做的。

05:13.541 --> 05:15.308
[laughing]
[笑]

05:15.308 --> 05:17.875
Only now I'll do it on my back.
只是现在我会在背上做。

05:17.875 --> 05:20.508
[laughing]
[笑]

05:20.508 --> 05:22.941
- Could you do it
without the laugh?
- 你能做到吗
没有笑声？

05:22.941 --> 05:24.141
- I won't lie to you, Larry.
- 我不会对你撒谎，拉里。

05:24.141 --> 05:26.775
Probably not.
[laughs]
可能不会。
[笑]

05:26.775 --> 05:28.108
- Whatever works, I guess.
- 我想，无论什么有效。

05:28.108 --> 05:30.275
Keep up with that
and most importantly--
跟上那个
最重要的是——

05:30.275 --> 05:32.641
- Always be hydrating.
- 始终保持水分。

05:32.641 --> 05:34.241
[laughing]
[笑]

05:34.241 --> 05:36.341
- [sighs]
Okay.
- [叹气]
好的。

05:36.341 --> 05:39.341
I have a lot of paperwork
to catch up on.
我有很多文书工作
赶上。

05:39.341 --> 05:42.108
- Free towels, free towels!
- 免费毛巾，免费毛巾！

05:42.108 --> 05:44.341
Free towels, free towels!
Free!
免费毛巾，免费毛巾！
自由的！

05:44.341 --> 05:46.175
- Do you have to do that
in front of me?
- 你必须这样做吗
在我面前？

05:46.175 --> 05:48.275
- Yes.
Yes, I do,
- 是的。
是的，我愿意，

05:48.275 --> 05:50.541
because I sincerely
want to thank you
因为我真诚地
想谢谢你

05:50.541 --> 05:53.108
for a truly life-changing
experience.
真正改变生活
经验。

05:53.108 --> 05:57.408
Sucker!
[laughs]
傻瓜！
[笑]

05:57.408 --> 05:59.141
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:59.141 --> 06:01.508
- Nice potbelly!
- 好大肚腩！

06:01.508 --> 06:03.541
- Potbelly?
- 大腹便便？

06:03.541 --> 06:05.175
[SpongeBob laughing]
[海绵宝宝大笑]

06:05.175 --> 06:07.208
Oh, I forgot all about
my protégé.
哦，我全忘了
我的门生。

06:07.208 --> 06:08.408
[SpongeBob laughs]
[海绵宝宝笑]

06:08.408 --> 06:09.475
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:09.475 --> 06:13.475
Oh, my Neptune!
哦，我的海王星！

06:13.475 --> 06:15.475
- Again with this!
- I have had it.
- 又是这个！
- 我已经受够了。

06:15.475 --> 06:18.008
- Come on, already.
- What's taking so long?
- 来吧，已经。
- 什么事要花这么长时间？

06:18.008 --> 06:19.108
[items crashing]
[物品崩溃]

06:19.108 --> 06:21.541
- Aah.
Oh.
- 啊啊。
哦。

06:21.541 --> 06:22.841
Oh.
哦。

06:22.841 --> 06:25.475
Aww, that's gonna come out
of my paycheck.
哇哦，这个会出来的
我的薪水。

06:26.875 --> 06:28.641
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:28.641 --> 06:31.008
- My legs!
- 我的腿！

06:31.008 --> 06:33.275
I'm okay.
我没事。

06:33.275 --> 06:35.408
[oven timer dings]
Slightly less okay.
[烤箱定时器的声音]
少一点还好。

06:35.408 --> 06:37.841
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

06:37.841 --> 06:39.275
- Yeah?
- 是的？

06:39.275 --> 06:40.775
- What are you--whoa,
you've been working out.
- 你是什么——哇，
你一直在锻炼。

06:40.775 --> 06:42.675
- Yeah, I hope you got
some glue for me
- 是的，我希望你能得到
给我一些胶水

06:42.675 --> 06:44.841
because I am ripped!
因为我被撕裂了！

06:44.841 --> 06:47.608
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:48.675 --> 06:50.208
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:50.208 --> 06:52.375
Oh, I'm late for the gym.
哦，我去健身房迟到了。

06:52.375 --> 06:54.208
Can you cover for me
in the kitchen, Squidward?
你能替我掩护吗
在厨房里，章鱼哥？

06:54.208 --> 06:56.141
- Yes.
Anything, you meathead.
- 是的。
什么都行，你这个肉头。

06:56.141 --> 06:58.775
Just go before
you destroy the place.
走之前就行
你毁了这个地方。

07:00.608 --> 07:02.075
[items crashing]
[物品崩溃]

07:05.008 --> 07:07.141
- Larry?
- Ugh.
- 拉里？
- 呃。

07:07.141 --> 07:09.408
- Gee, Larry, you've really
let yourself go.
- 哎呀，拉里，你真的
放手吧。

07:09.408 --> 07:10.875
- With all this paperwork,
- 有了所有这些文书工作，

07:10.875 --> 07:13.341
I haven't had any time
to do my crunches.
我还没有时间
做仰卧起坐。

07:13.341 --> 07:15.941
The only thing I've been
crunching is numbers.
我唯一做过的事
运算就是数字。

07:15.941 --> 07:18.608
But I'm gonna get back in shape.
You'll see.
但我会恢复体形的。
你会看到的。

07:18.608 --> 07:20.541
- Yeah, Larry, sure you will.
- 是的，拉里，你当然会的。

07:20.541 --> 07:22.875
- SpongeBob,
tell me the truth.
- 海绵宝宝，
告诉我真相。

07:22.875 --> 07:25.541
Do I have a potbelly?
我有大肚腩吗？

07:25.541 --> 07:28.541
- I--no, Larry,
don't be silly.
- 我——不，拉里，
别傻了。

07:28.541 --> 07:31.408
You don't have a potbelly.
你没有大肚腩。

07:31.408 --> 07:32.641
- Ugh.
- 呃。

07:32.641 --> 07:36.608
See you in exercise class,
I guess.
运动课上见
我猜。

07:36.608 --> 07:40.408
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:40.408 --> 07:42.141
- Oh, boy!
Free soup!
- 哦，孩子！
免费汤！

07:42.141 --> 07:45.208
[slurps]
Little heavy on the salt.
[啜饮]
盐有点重。

07:45.208 --> 07:47.775
[all muttering]
[大家嘀咕]

07:47.775 --> 07:49.775
- Oh, he'll be here.
Don't worry.
- 哦，他会在这里。
不用担心。

07:49.775 --> 07:52.175
Larry made me
the man I am today.
拉里让我
今天的我。

07:52.175 --> 07:53.608
- Oh, look at that.
- Oh, wow.
- 哦，看看那个。
- 哦，哇。

07:53.608 --> 07:56.041
- He taught me
just do stuff you always do
- 他教我的
做你经常做的事情

07:56.041 --> 07:57.775
but do it on your back.
但要在背上做。

07:57.775 --> 07:59.075
Laugh on your back.
笑在你的背上。

07:59.075 --> 08:01.775
[laughing]
[笑]

08:01.775 --> 08:04.375
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

08:04.375 --> 08:07.275
Walk on your back.
背着走。

08:07.275 --> 08:09.541
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

08:09.541 --> 08:12.041
And don't forget,
always be hydrating.
并且不要忘记，
始终保持保湿。

08:12.041 --> 08:14.975
That means
drink plenty of water.
这意味着
多喝水。

08:14.975 --> 08:17.108
all:
Ah.
全部：
啊。

08:17.108 --> 08:18.775
- I hope Larry's okay.
- 我希望拉里没事。

08:18.775 --> 08:20.075
While we're waiting,
当我们等待的时候，

08:20.075 --> 08:22.541
I guess we can ride bicycles
on our backs.
我想我们可以骑自行车
在我们的背上。

08:22.541 --> 08:25.675
[all grunting and groaning]
[所有的咕哝声和呻吟声]

08:27.075 --> 08:30.275
- Hmm.
[moaning]
- 唔。
[呻吟]

08:32.341 --> 08:35.341
- Hey, Larry, thanks for
all the free steam.
- 嘿，拉里，谢谢你
所有的自由蒸汽。

08:35.341 --> 08:36.875
[laughs]
Sucker.
[笑]
傻瓜。

08:36.875 --> 08:38.775
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

08:41.008 --> 08:44.141
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:48.175 --> 08:50.808
Oh, what's the use?
哦，那有什么用呢？

08:53.775 --> 08:54.941
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

08:54.941 --> 08:58.208
Ah, who am I kidding?
啊，我在跟谁开玩笑呢？

08:58.208 --> 09:00.175
- You wanted to see me, sir?
- 你想见我吗，先生？

09:00.175 --> 09:03.575
- Yeah, look, uh,
you're obviously
- 是的，看，呃，
你显然是

09:03.575 --> 09:06.275
the alpha male
at the gym now,
雄性领袖
现在在健身房，

09:06.275 --> 09:08.341
and I'm just a shell
of my former self.
而我只是一个躯壳
以前的我。

09:08.341 --> 09:09.775
- I hear ya, Larry.
- 我听到了，拉里。

09:09.775 --> 09:11.908
I just want to get back
to the Krusty--
我只想回来
致库斯蒂——

09:11.908 --> 09:13.475
- I need you
to take over.
- 我需要你
接管。

09:13.475 --> 09:15.475
You're a natural leader,
SpongeBob.
你是天生的领导者
海绵宝宝。

09:15.475 --> 09:17.775
You should be in charge
of the fun stuff
你应该负责
有趣的事情

09:17.775 --> 09:19.575
while I sit here
in the reception area
当我坐在这里时
在接待区

09:19.575 --> 09:22.141
slowly getting fatter
and paler until I die.
慢慢变胖
直到我死为止，脸色都变得苍白。

09:22.141 --> 09:23.808
- It sounds great.
- 听起来很棒。

09:23.808 --> 09:24.908
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

09:24.908 --> 09:27.375
- Oh, Larry, look at me.
- 哦，拉里，看着我。

09:27.375 --> 09:30.175
I'm too big
to work the grill anymore.
我太大了
不再在烤架上工作了。

09:30.175 --> 09:31.575
That makes me sad.
这让我很难过。

09:31.575 --> 09:34.208
- Come over here
and give me a bro hug.
- 过来这里
给我一个兄弟般的拥抱。

09:34.208 --> 09:35.508
- You mean a "brug"?
- 你的意思是“布鲁格”？

09:35.508 --> 09:37.308
- I don't wanna
call it that.
- 我不想
就这么称呼吧。

09:37.308 --> 09:38.808
- Here's to our new lives.
- 为我们的新生活干杯。

09:38.808 --> 09:41.941
Our terrible,
terrible, new lives.
我们可怕的，
可怕的新生命。

09:41.941 --> 09:45.841
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

09:45.841 --> 09:47.608
Oh, whoa, what happened?
哦，哇，发生了什么事？

09:47.608 --> 09:50.341
- Dude, you were
just over hydrated.
- 伙计，你是
只是水分过多。

09:50.341 --> 09:52.075
Those weren't real muscles.
那些不是真正的肌肉。

09:52.075 --> 09:53.541
They were water muscles.
他们是水肌。

09:53.541 --> 09:56.175
- Larry, your "brug"
was so super strong,
- 拉里，你的“布鲁格”
是如此的超级强大，

09:56.175 --> 09:58.108
it took the water muscles
right out of me.
它消耗了水肌肉
就在我身边。

09:58.108 --> 09:59.308
- Don't say "brug."
- 不要说“布鲁格”。

09:59.308 --> 10:01.675
- [laughs]
Brug.
- [笑]
布鲁格。

10:01.675 --> 10:04.608
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

10:08.375 --> 10:11.775
- SpongeBob, laughing on my back
was just what I needed.
- 海绵宝宝，在我背上笑
这正是我所需要的。

10:11.775 --> 10:14.475
You're a pretty good
instructor after all.
你是一个很不错的人
毕竟是导师。

10:14.475 --> 10:18.675
Oh, boy, the way you laugh
really gets on my nerves.
哦，男孩，你笑起来的样子
真让我心烦意乱。

10:18.675 --> 10:21.008
- [laughing]
- [笑]

10:21.008 --> 10:23.241
- The very next evening...
- 就在第二天晚上...

10:24.375 --> 10:27.775
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:27.775 --> 10:30.508
- Well, that was the last
customer, SpongeBob.
- 嗯，那是最后一次
顾客，海绵宝宝。

10:31.508 --> 10:33.008
- Oh, what a great day.
- 哦，多么美好的一天啊。

10:33.008 --> 10:35.241
- And you know why
it was a great day?
- 你知道为什么
这是美好的一天吗？

10:35.241 --> 10:37.908
Because Krabs never even
showed up.
因为螃蟹从来没有
出现了。

10:39.641 --> 10:42.175
- Huh?
[sniffing]
- 啊？
[嗅嗅]

10:42.175 --> 10:44.275
What is that smell?
那是什么气味？

10:44.275 --> 10:47.408
Mr. Krabs, how long
have you been in there?
蟹老板，多久了
你去过那里吗？

10:49.141 --> 10:50.675
- I think I'm done.
- 我想我已经完成了。

10:50.675 --> 10:52.775
Would you mind rubbing
a little butter on me?
你介意擦吗
我身上有一点黄油吗？

10:55.975 --> 10:58.975
[mellow tropical music]
【柔和的热带音乐】

10:58.975 --> 11:06.908
* *
**
